{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"嶺南中學學生疑遭同學欺凌　警方拘捕三名男童\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/PUPIL-BULLY-261113-23.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】杏花村嶺南中學一名男學生懷疑被同學拳打腳踢，警方以涉嫌普通襲擊拘捕三名男童。</p><p>三人年齡介乎13至15歲，獲准保釋候查，須於12月中旬向警方報到。</p><p>事發在周二下午，一名13歲男童在學校吃飯時被多人襲擊。校方稱已啟動危機處理機制，展開調查及聯絡家長，配合警方調查。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T16:03:43.020724+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T15:02:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T23:02:53.876501+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:57:16.076221+00:00","content_hash":"2edd043988af65c3d2ea46fb918f16a80d924ca20d7e027f84f56d5ac4afd067","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}